@NewLowObserver @johnarnold RE: “Folks have been saying the same thing since 1950.”

Not sure they have, & at any rate, US pulled silver out of the coinage in 1964 à la Rome, defaulted on int’l gold obligations in 1971, & from 1950-75, debt/GDP was inflated down to 25%

Ie, it’s a process & comes in waves

